ipeInstructions\">Reduce heat to medium low, and simmer, covered, until thickened and lentils are completely tender, about 1 hour. Discard bay leaf. Puree 2 cups soup until smooth. Return pureed soup to pot and stir in kale and ham. Simmer, covered, until kale is tender, about 10 minutes. Season with salt and pepper. Serve.</li> </ol> <div class=\"ERSClear\"></div> </div> <div class=\"endeasyrecipe\" title=\"style002\" style=\"display: none\">3.5.3226</div> </div><br />\n </p>\n"
